1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:02,264
The objective is to give correct answers.

2
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:04,393
(Sheldon:)If I know them,
why shouldn't I give them?

3
00:00:04,602 --> 00:00:07,312
(Howard:)Some of us might have
the correct answers too.

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:10,230
(Sheldon:)- Please. You don't even have a Ph.D.
- All right, that's it.

5
00:00:10,399 --> 00:00:12,689
- Howard, sit down.
- Okay.

6
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:17,160
(Leonard:)- We should take a little break.
- Good idea. I need my wrist brace.

7
00:00:17,323 --> 00:00:20,613
(Sheldon:)All this button pushing is aggravating
my old Nintendo injury.

8
00:00:20,785 --> 00:00:21,825
[WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY]

9
00:00:21,994 --> 00:00:23,034
(Howard(after Raj whispers in his ear):)I agree.

10
00:00:23,204 --> 00:00:24,244
(Penny:)What did he say?

11
00:00:24,663 --> 00:00:29,373
(Howard:)He compared Sheldon to a disposable
feminine cleansing product...

12
00:00:29,543 --> 00:00:32,173
(Howard:)...one might use on a summer's eve.

13
00:00:34,298 --> 00:00:36,968
(Penny:)Yeah, and the bag it came in.

14
00:00:40,846 --> 00:00:43,016
(Sheldon:)Leonard, excellent.
I wanna show you something.

15
00:00:43,182 --> 00:00:45,062
Can it wait? I need to talk to you.

16
00:00:45,226 --> 00:00:48,356
(Sheldon:)Just look. I've designed
the perfect uniforms for our team.

17
00:00:48,521 --> 00:00:51,111
The colors are based
on Star Trek: The Original Series.

18
00:00:51,273 --> 00:00:56,023
(Sheldon:)The three of you will wear support red
and I will wear command gold.

